      "value": 20,
      "text": "NEUROLICTOR/LICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit only. In your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of this unit, this unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3\".",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
      "id": "enhancement-biophagic-flow-aura",
      "title": "Biophagic Flow (Aura)",
      "detachment": "Assimilation Swarm",
      "value": 10,
      "text": "Tyranids model only. While a friendly Harvester model is within 12\" of the bearer, when using the Feed the Swarm ability, that Harvester model can Regenerate one friendly Tyranids unit that is within 9\" instead of one within 6\".",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
      "id": "enhancement-instinctive-defense",
      "title": "Instinctive Defense",
      "detachment": "Assimilation Swarm",
      "value": 15,
      "text": "TYRANIDS model only. While the bearer is within 6\" of one or more friendly HARVESTER units, when you target this unit with the Heroic Intervention stratagem, that use is -1 CP. In addition, while the bearer is within 6\" of one or more friendly HARVESTER units, models in the bearer's unit have the Fights First ability.",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
      "id": "enhancement-parasitic-biomorphology",
      "title": "Parasitic Biomorphology",
      "detachment": "Assimilation Swarm",
      "value": 25,
      "text": "Tyranids model only. Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit. The first time the bearer's unit destroys an enemy unit in the Fight phase while the bearer is within 6\" of one or more Harvester units, until the end of battle, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit.",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
      "id": "enhancement-regenerating-monstrosity",
      "title": "Regenerating Monstrosity",
      "detachment": "Assimilation Swarm",
      "value": 20,
      "text": "Tyranids model only (excluding Monsters models) The bearer's unit can be regenerated up to twice per phase, instead of once.",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
      "id": "enhancement-enraged-reserves",
      "title": "Enraged Reserves",
      "detachment": "Crusher Stampede",
      "value": 20,
      "text": "Tyranids Monster only. If the bearer is destroyed by a melee attack, if it has not fought this phase, roll one D6: on a 3+, do not remove it from play. It can fight after the attacking model's unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play.",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
      "id": "enhancement-monstrous-nemesis",
      "title": "Monstrous Nemesis",
      "detachment": "Crusher Stampede",
      "value": 25,
      "text": "Tyranids Monster only. Each time the bearer makes a melee attack that targets a Monsteror Vehicleunit, add 1 to the Wound roll.",
      "profile": null
    },
    {
